{"parentUuid":"5e84cf5f-97da-42a0-be3f-4e25eaf89b4f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfztb5fmUKxs1eGHMdBmA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014MH4avDyKvUkjSpF6kxLSs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site && node -e \"\nconst en=require('./src/components/docs/guide.json'), fr=require('./src/components/docs/guide.fr.json');\nfor (const id of ['orientation','conversation','fitting','new-persona','tokens','generate']) { const e=en.find(c=>c.id===id), f=fr.find(c=>c.id===id); console.log('##', id, '|', e.title, '|', f.title, '| screen:', e.screen, '| href:', e.href); e.paragraphs.forEach(p=>console.log('  -', p)); }\n\"; cat src/components/docs/guide.css","description":"Read the relevant guide chapters and guide CSS"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9926,"cache_read_input_tokens":194666,"output_tokens":300,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9926,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":300,"cache_read_input_tokens":194666,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9926},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014MH4avDyKvUkjSpF6kxLSs":{"command":"cd /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site && node -e \"\nconst en=require('./src/components/docs/guide.json'), fr=require('./src/components/docs/guide.fr.json');\nfor (const id of ['orientation','conversation','fitting','new-persona','tokens','generate']) { const e=en.find(c=>c.id===id), f=fr.find(c=>c.id===id); console.log('##', id, '|', e.title, '|', f.title, '| screen:', e.screen, '| href:', e.href); e.paragraphs.forEach(p=>console.log('  -', p)); }\n\"; cat src/components/docs/guide.css","description":"Read the relevant guide chapters and guide CSS"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d1eb27f5-3cc8-4a71-ab46-5cb0a3745a8c","timestamp":"2026-10-13T20:45:50.224Z","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
{"parentUuid":"d1eb27f5-3cc8-4a71-ab46-5cb0a3745a8c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8c888221-02b0-4e51-9d65-3c44adc1a85c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014MH4avDyKvUkjSpF6kxLSs","type":"tool_result","content":"## orientation | Find your way around | Se repérer dans le Studio | screen: fitting | href: /gui/\n  - The wardrobe holds your personas. Choose one, or use New persona to describe someone of your own. Fitting shows what their films, music, spaces and habits become in an interface.\n  - The worktable has two groups: Measure contains Fitting, Material and Tokens; Make contains Generate, Moodboard and Taste. OpenPencil is inside Tokens. Brand kit appears for custom personas. Projects and Settings open separate views.\n  - Check the connection indicator. Demo work stays in this browser tab and resets on reload. Live means Studio reached its server; check Settings for your account and available services. Download anything you want to keep before leaving a demo.\n## conversation | Talk with a companion | Parler avec un compagnon | screen: undefined | href: /#meet\n  - Meet Moss, Ren and Ada on the home page. Each has a different cultural world and a conversation about their taste. The label tells you whether you are exploring an authored guided demo or an AI conversation.\n  - When voice is available, tap Talk and allow microphone access. Tap Finish when you are done; you can speak for up to 45 seconds. Your audio goes to fal for transcription. Review or edit the words in the message field, then press Send. Cancel discards the recording.\n  - Turn on Spoken replies to hear future answers, or choose Listen to reply for the latest one. The indicator distinguishes listening, thinking, preparing a voice, speaking and paused playback. Pause keeps your place; Resume continues; Stop ends playback. Switching companions or leaving the tab stops the microphone and audio.\n  - Typing remains available when voice is unavailable or permission is denied. The conversation keeps each companion’s messages and draft while you switch, but does not save them across a page reload.\n## fitting | Read the fitting | Lire l’essayage | screen: fitting | href: /gui/?tab=fitting\n  - Fitting turns the persona into a visible system: palette roles, typography, spacing, edges, motion and an interface specimen. Compare the preview with the cultural measurements rather than choosing a palette in isolation.\n  - Scroll through the specimen to inspect buttons, fields, cards, navigation, status and messaging. Hover interactive samples to feel motion. Changing the selected persona updates the fitting and the other tabs.\n  - The fitting is a preview, not a deployed application. Contrast, content length and interactions still need validation in the interface where you will use the tokens. Demo custom personas borrow the nearest built-in token fixture; their measurements do not trigger fresh token generation.\n## new-persona | Create a persona | Créer un persona | screen: new | href: /gui/?new=1\n  - Choose New persona. Enter a name, check its generated slug, add a region and a short description. The slug is a lowercase identifier used in routes and file names; it is separate from the display name.\n  - Fill Culture with subcultures and values. In Influences, list films, anime or shows, music genres, musicians and visual artists. Habitat covers spaces, tools and obsessions. Behaviour captures software values and pet peeves. Separate list items with commas.\n  - In The cut, choose the aesthetic axes, then add visual and mood keywords. Be concrete: a named film, a familiar place and an actual working habit give a clearer brief than a generic adjective. The completion meter counts filled measurements; it is not a quality score.\n  - Select Add to wardrobe. A successful save selects the new persona and returns to Fitting. A name is required. Keep a unique slug to avoid replacing another custom persona. Cancel returns without saving the form.\n## tokens | Export design tokens | Exporter les jetons de design | screen: tokens | href: /gui/?tab=tokens\n  - Open Tokens and choose CSS variables, Tailwind, Panda or JSON. The code panel updates for the selected format. CSS produces .css, Tailwind .js, Panda .ts and JSON .json.\n  - Copy sends the displayed export to the browser clipboard. Download saves a file named after the persona. If clipboard access is denied, use Download or select the code manually. The code and variable identifiers stay unchanged when the UI language changes.\n  - The side panels show the spacing scale, radius and shadow samples, and easing curves. Hover an easing row to preview motion. These are integration references, not an automatic installation into your app.\n  - Downloads survive a demo reset because they are browser files. In the demo, saving an OpenPencil document does not regenerate these exports; export tokens and the editable document are separate demo stores.\n## generate | Draft prompts and generate | Préparer les consignes et générer | screen: generate | href: /gui/?tab=generate\n  - Open Generate and leave Dry run enabled for your first attempt. Choose Asset suite or Full UI kit, then Draft the prompts. Read the image, SVG and video briefs before making images.\n  - In the browser demo, jobs are simulated and no assets are generated. With generation available, choose an image model and review your spending limit before turning off Dry run. Follow the job’s progress and reopen earlier jobs from the history.\n  - Hosted generation covers images and judging. A full kit also needs SVG and video services. If a service is unavailable, you can still draft prompts and continue refining your persona.\n.docs-audiences { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc8bb; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n.docs-audiences a { min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; color: #57544b; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }\n.docs-audiences a[aria-current=\"page\"] { border-color: #b3311b; color: #1c1b19; font-weight: 600; }\n.docs-audiences a:hover { color: #b3311b; }\n.guide-page { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 32px 0; }\n.guide-heading { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n.guide-heading h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.08; max-width: 16ch; }\n.guide-heading p { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 65ch; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #514c42; }\n.guide-language { display: flex; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 16px; padding-top: 12px; }\n.guide-language a { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-size: 14px; }\n.guide-language a[aria-current=\"true\"] { color: #1c1b19; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }\n.guide-watch { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.3fr) minmax(230px, 1fr); gap: 32px; padding: 32px 0 42px; border-top: 1px solid #cfc8bb; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc8bb; }\n.guide-watch h2 { font-family: var(--fonts-display); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.18; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n.guide-watch p { color: #514c42; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 70ch; }\n.guide-watch video { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: #eee9de; border: 1px solid #cfc8bb; border-radius: 4px; }\n.guide-recordings { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin: 20px 0; gap: 4px; }\n.guide-recordings button { min-height: 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; color: #35312b; background: transparent; font-size: 14px; }\n.guide-recordings button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { border-color: #bbb2a1; background: #fbf9f4; font-weight: 600; }\n.guide-recordings button:hover { background: #e9e3d7; }\n.guide-recordings small { white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; color: #5d574a; }\n.guide-downloads { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 20px; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; }\n.guide-downloads a { min-height: 36px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }\n.guide-watch .guide-recording-note { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #5d574a; }\n.guide-transcript { margin-top: 20px; }\n.guide-transcript summary, .guide-edition summary { padding: 8px 0; color: #254dc5; font-size: 14px; }\n.guide-transcript h3 { margin: 16px 0 5px; font-size: 16px; }\n.guide-transcript p { margin-top: 8px; }\n.guide-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 48px; align-items: start; margin-top: 42px; }\n.guide-outline { position: sticky; top: 90px; max-height: calc(100svh - 120px); overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 12px; }\n.guide-outline h2 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.guide-outline a { display: block; padding: 7px 0; color: #514c42; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }\n.guide-outline a:hover { text-decoration: underline; color: #254dc5; }\n.guide-outline .guide-developer-link { border-top: 1px solid #cfc8bb; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 14px; color: #254dc5; }\n.guide-jump { display: none; }\n.guide-chapters { min-width: 0; }\n.guide-chapter { border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc8bb; scroll-margin-top: 90px; }\n.guide-chapter > summary { list-style: none; min-height: 74px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 20px 0; }\n.guide-chapter > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.guide-chapter > summary::after { content: '+'; color: #a8321f; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.guide-chapter[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }\n.guide-chapter h2 { font-family: var(--fonts-display); font-size: clamp(23px, 2.4vw, 30px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; }\n.guide-chapter-body { padding: 0 0 30px; }\n.guide-chapter p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 73ch; color: #514c42; margin: 0 0 16px; }\n.guide-chapter figure { margin-top: 24px; }\n.guide-chapter img { width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid #cfc8bb; border-radius: 4px; }\n.guide-chapter figcaption { color: #5d574a; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 8px; }\n.guide-edition { margin-top: 34px; }\n.guide-edition p { font-size: 14px; color: #514c42; line-height: 1.7; margin: 12px 0; max-width: 70ch; }\n.guide-page a:focus-visible, .guide-page button:focus-visible, .guide-page summary:focus-visible, .guide-page select:focus-visible, .docs-audiences a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #254dc5; outline-offset: 4px; }\n.guide-watch button, .guide-chapter summary, .guide-transcript summary, .guide-edition summary { cursor: pointer; }\n@media (max-width: 979px) {\n  .guide-watch { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .guide-recordings { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0 0; gap: 8px; }\n  .guide-recordings button { flex: 1 1 170px; }\n  .guide-outline { display: none; }\n  .guide-layout { display: block; margin-top: 24px; }\n  .guide-jump { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; }\n  .guide-jump select { background: #fbf9f4; border: 1px solid #bbb2a1; border-radius: 4px; min-height: 44px; width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 16px; color: #1c1b19; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .guide-page { padding: 20px 20px 0; }\n  .docs-audiences { gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; }\n  .guide-heading { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .guide-heading p { font-size: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .guide-language { padding: 0; }\n  .guide-watch { padding: 24px 0 30px; }\n  .guide-recordings { flex-direction: column; }\n  .guide-recordings button { flex: none; }\n  .guide-chapter > summary { gap: 16px; }\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"eaa427e1-6189-4a6c-9579-ee24248daa6c","timestamp":"2026-10-13T20:45:50.279Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 