{"parentUuid":"146ae1e4-ca8d-4161-a78f-421566f89df3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":["/home/diogenes/.t3/userdata/attachments"],"platform":"linux","shell":"bash","osVersion":"Linux 6.19.14-108.fc42.x86_64"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a980f601-0d43-4660-a1a9-d06ca2d03bf7","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:13:57.943Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste (was /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
{"parentUuid":"a980f601-0d43-4660-a1a9-d06ca2d03bf7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfzvjphLnvrzsv25mJ3sH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice the guide text saying \"jobs are simulated and no assets are generated\" is a bit outdated compared to the actual behavior, where base personas replay a recorded run instead of simulating fresh jobs — but the core claim that no assets are generated still holds true.\n\nLooking at the archive clip itself, from 6.0 to 34.9 seconds it shows the generate form with fal selected, dry run toggled off, then clicking generate: progress logs appear, the archive map fills in, and finally the cut shows 5 assets. I'm drafting a caption along the lines of \"The browser demo replaying a recorded fal run: drafts land on the archive map, then the cut,\" dated October 10, 2026, and considering whether to update the guide paragraph to say base personas replay a recorded run rather than simulate jobs, then checking the French guide for the same inconsistency.\n\nI want to refine the demo description to say base personas replay a real recorded run while custom personas only draft prompts, matching the actual demo-client behavior, and update both the English and French text accordingly. For the conversation chapter about meeting Moss, Ren and Ada, I'll caption that clip as recorded on the home page, dated October 10, 2026, then move on to reviewing guide.css, the README outline, docs/development.md, the .env.example file, and the base tokens in global.css.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16747,"cache_read_input_tokens":232814,"output_tokens":1036,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":819},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16