{"parentUuid":"c52b1fc8-3a5a-4a95-9c64-06960d01fef3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfzvypxMXqsq7yndzrAAt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking whether the videoLang signal gets typed as a widened `string` instead of the literal union `'fr' | 'en'`, since TypeScript might infer the broader type from that conditional expression unless I constrain it explicitly.\n\nSince T isn't top-level in the return type, it gets widened to `string`, which means `videoLang` ends up typed as plain `string` rather than the literal union, causing `tour.captions[videoLang]` to fail type checking since the captions object only has `en`/`fr` keys. I'll fix it by narrowing with a ternary check against 'fr', then move on to adding CSS for `.guide-clip` and `.guide-wide` with a 16/9 aspect ratio to match the tour video styling.\n\nAlso removing the redundant cursor-pointer override in guide.css, and updating the generate-mode explanation text in both guide.json and guide.fr.json to reflect that base personas replay a recorded run while custom personas only draft prompts without generating new assets.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4951,"cache_read_input_tokens":276611,"output_tokens":1924,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1044},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4951,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1924,"cache_read_input_tokens":276611,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4951},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13600,"thinki