{"parentUuid":"325fa503-a086-4f2b-80af-fbab5891f39b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfzw9AdJ7bSgYvkpBmFde","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The landing tour section at 1440 width looks fine overall—the intro paragraph and heading alignment check out with the paragraph bottom roughly matching the heading bottom. I'm now noticing a potential issue in the playing screenshot that needs a closer look.\n\nOn mobile at 390px, the chapter rail scrolls horizontally but \"Fitting room\" truncates with an ellipsis since the width calc is too tight—I should bump the per-character multiplier from 11px to around 14px so labels like \"Fitting room\" fit without clipping. I'm also double-checking the chapter timestamps against tour.json's actual start times, confirming they floor correctly to 0:08, 0:19, 0:54, and 1:03 given the voiceStart offset.\n\nLooking at the hero section, \"Watch the tour 1:14\" fits well between the persona and fitting CTAs, and the docs-watch screenshot of `.guide-watch` looks fine with native video controls. Now I'm noticing a possible visual issue in the \"Draft prompts and generate\" section where there seems to be a translucent white block overlapping the chapter text behind the paragraphs, which I need to investigate further.\n\nI'm wondering if this white panel is related to the `:target` state since we navigated to `#generate`, but checking guide.css I don't see a `:target` rule defined. It might instead be an artifact of the FabricBackdrop's linen texture effect rather than something caused by my changes, so I want to verify this isn't a real regression before moving on.\n\nThe clip screenshot just captures the first frame of the archive take, so that's fine. For the 500 error, I should check which URL triggered it — likely a health check endpoint hitting the Vite proxy while the API isn't running, which would be pre-existing behavior; I'll check the Vite log for proxy errors to confirm, then also look at the French mobile guide screenshot.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9714,"cache_read_input_tokens":289257,"output_tokens":1914,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1716},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9714,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1914,"cache_read_input_tokens":289257,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9714,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9714},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":19766,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f10ee695-b2b1-411e-baaf-61a6a3650aa2","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:19:37.024Z","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
