ault)"," TYPESAFE_API_KEY=...      # TypeSafe System One (Jev) judge, auto-selected when set"," GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIza...     # Gemini images / Veo video (optional)","+FAL_KEY=...                # fal: --provider fal for every stage, and companion voice"," ```"," ","+## The tour video","+","+The tour is a [HyperFrames](https://hyperframes.heygen.com/) composition in `videos/baste-tour/`, cut from","+screens recorded on this site. `scripts/record-tour.mjs` records them, `scripts/narrate-tour.mjs` and","+`scripts/score-tour.mjs` make the narration and music on fal, `build.mjs` composes it, and `publish.mjs` puts the","+video, captions and the Studio guide's chapter clips into `site/public/media/tour/`. See","+[local development](docs/development.md#tour-video) for the commands.","+"," ## Architecture"," "," ```"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/docs/development.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":85,"oldLines":6,"newStart":85,"newLines":28,"lines":[" "," For the hosted account path, see [Not Organic integration](notorganic.md). Local CLI calls do not receive a browser's hosted account session."," ","+## Tour video","+","+The 74-second tour on the home page and in the Studio guide is a HyperFrames composition in `videos/baste-tour/`. Each step writes files the next one reads, so any step can be redone alone:","+","+```sh","+# Screens, recorded from the running site with the system Chrome on the GPU","+env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH node scripts/record-tour.mjs        # footage/*.webm, clips.json, cfr/*.mp4","+# Narration (ElevenLabs Aria, fal Whisper word timings) and the music bed (Stable Audio 2.5), all on fal","+node scripts/narrate-tour.mjs --skate                       # narration/","+node scripts/score-tour.mjs --skate                         # music/bed.mp3","+cd videos/baste-tour","+node build.mjs                                              # index.html, captions.vtt, captions.fr.vtt, assets/voice/","+env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH npx --yes hyperframes@0.8.145 check","+env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH npx --yes hyperframes@0.8.145 snapshot --at 20,43,60","+env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH npx --yes hyperframes@0.8.145 render --quality high --fps 30 --output renders/baste-tour.mp4","+node publish.mjs                                            # site/public/media/tour/, site/src/lib/tour.json","+```","+","+`build.mjs` holds the edit: the seconds of each recording that play, their speed, the wipes and the camera moves. It refuses a cut that starts before 3.6 s, while the development overlay is still on screen, or that runs past the end of a take. French subtitles live in `narration/captions.fr.json`, one line per English cue; the build stops if the counts differ. `--skate` reads `fal_api_key@secrets`; otherwise set `FAL_KEY`. The key is only held in the process.","+","+The render's preflight runs `ldd` on its Chrome. On a Nix or Guix host, unset `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` and put the system `ldd` first on `PATH` (for example a directory holding a link to `/usr/bin/ldd`). A render is cancelled when the shell that launched it exits; set `HYPERFRAMES_RENDER_DETACHED=1` to run one in the background. Footage, renders, snapshots and `.work/` are build products and stay out of Git; the published files under `site/public/media/tour/` are what the site serves.","+"," ## Verification boundaries"," "," The fabric regression check exercises window resizing, a lost WebGL context, and touch viewport changes while scrolling. It checks that no resized canvas reaches paint before being redrawn, inspects the rendered background, and saves screenshots plus a report under `/tmp/baste-fabric-qa`:"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/README.md","/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/docs/development.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3d948bfd-0ef0-49bf-849f-cf10aa972466","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69af