{"parentUuid":"4afff9af-bc39-4b5f-b7c4-d0cebfa130d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfzwj4bqod76p2AqEjgda","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I recall the verify-guide-voice script timing out waiting for the \"Finish\" button, which is a pre-existing issue needing the fal API key—I'll flag it as still open rather than fix it now. I also confirm FAL_KEY is already present in .env.example, so that's fine.\n\nI still need to check the contact sheet for the final reply; the skill rules require stating the MP4 path, duration, and including the contact sheet image, which lives at videos/baste-tour/renders/contact-sheet.jpg and remains valid since captions weren't burned into the video. I also want to verify the footage-v1 deletion is safe before proceeding, since removing 157 MB is destructive and I should inspect its contents first.\n\nI'll leave footage-v1 in place since it's now gitignored and causes no harm, just noting it could be removed later. I should also mention the dev server is still running on :5173, and double-check git status for any pre-existing build output changes.\n\nThe build regenerated site/server files that were already tracked and modified, which is consistent with the repo's practice of committing build output, so that's fine. I want to also verify how the hero's \"Watch the tour\" button row wraps on mobile by revisiting the hero-390.png screenshot from earlier.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":193855,"cache_read_input_tokens":92618,"output_tokens":1086,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1018},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":193855,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_t