{"parentUuid":"ddbe7dce-d3f3-4219-856f-75011aba5a9d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- agent-swarm-app-improvement: Run a multi-model agent swarm (T3 delegate_task / Agent tool) to review, rethink, and fix an application end to end: parallel expert reviews, holistic product/competitive analysis, a \"grand unified\" vision pass, scoped parallel fix lanes, an independent cross-model reviewer, and verification gates. Use when the user asks to review a repo from several angles, \"spin up subagents\", fix many issues at once, use specific models (Sonnet/Sol/Luna/Astra/Fable/Opus), improve product positioning, or \"fully utilize the agent swarm\". Not for single small fixes.","skillCount":1,"isInitial":false,"names":["agent-swarm-app-improvement"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"dfed9bc6-984b-4a09-97fa-5d739a0d20b6","timestamp":"2026-10-14T02:45:58.969Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- agent-swarm-app-improvement: Run a multi-model agent swarm (T3 delegate_task / Agent tool) to review, rethink, and fix an application end to end: parallel expert reviews, holistic product/competitive analysis, a \"grand unified\" vision pass, scoped parallel fix lanes, an independent cross-model reviewer, and verification gates. Use when the user asks to review a repo from several angles, \"spin up subagents\", fix many issues at once, use specific models (Sonnet/Sol/Luna/Astra/Fable/Opus), improve product positioning, or \"fully utilize the agent swarm\". Not for single small fixes.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
