{"parentUuid":"7c2f75a5-6d77-4a90-954a-55671708feb5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1165d7a1-30cf-4c4e-a93c-fed0ec3c3592","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0121nSRByAoZfwbHVibunJZc","type":"tool_result","content":"[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"fit\",\n    \"title\": \"Design for a person.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Make an interface feel like it belongs to someone. In Baste, start with a persona’s films, music, spaces and working habits. The fitting makes that world visible through colour, type and interface details.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"measure\",\n    \"title\": \"Take specific measurements.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Tailor a copy or measure a new persona. Give it a name and a clear description. Add concrete influences, values and software preferences. Choose the aesthetic axes and visual keywords. Save deliberately; the completion meter measures filled fields, not design quality.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"tokens\",\n    \"title\": \"Keep a usable pattern.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"In Tokens, compare spacing, edges and motion, then export CSS, Tailwind, Panda or JSON. Downloaded files stay on your device. The demo uses built-in token examples; custom measurements do not start fresh generation.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"taste\",\n    \"title\": \"Show it what fits.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Build a moodboard from image references, tags and notes. Pin the important references; leave the notes field to save it. In Taste, name an asset, explain your verdict and ask for more or less of that style. Inspect the feedback that later prompts can use.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"draft\",\n    \"title\": \"Draft before you generate.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Start Generate with a dry run and inspect the prompt. This browser demo simulates jobs and makes no paid calls. OpenPenci\n6 [ 'id,title,paragraph', 'id,title,paragraph' ]\n{\n  \"recovered_from_commit\": \"da12cec\",\n  \"recovered_from_ref\": \"origin/main at f801bbd9728eb7aecaf19854f