\n    \"paragraph\": \"In Tokens, compare spacing, edges and motion, then export CSS, Tailwind, Panda or JSON. Downloaded files stay on your device. The demo uses built-in token examples; custom measurements do not start fresh generation.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"taste\",\n    \"title\": \"Show it what fits.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Build a moodboard from image references, tags and notes. Pin the important references; leave the notes field to save it. In Taste, name an asset, explain your verdict and ask for more or less of that style. Inspect the feedback that later prompts can use.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"draft\",\n    \"title\": \"Draft before you generate.\",\n    \"paragraph\": \"Start Generate with a dry run and inspect the prompt. This browser demo simulates jobs and makes no paid calls. OpenPenci\n6 [ 'id,title,paragraph', 'id,title,paragraph' ]\n{\n  \"recovered_from_commit\": \"da12cec\",\n  \"recovered_from_ref\": \"origin/main at f801bbd9728eb7aecaf19854f9127fbce4fa083c\",\n  \"published_at\": \"2026-10-02\",\n  \"source\": \"https://baste.love/docs/\",\n  \"local_base_before_recovery\": \"00e21ea3b8fcbc3f488d65cd78c2e6b78294966f\",\n  \"scope\": [\n    \"Guide text and published media restored from Git\",\n    \"Studio instructions updated for Material, Taste, and OpenPencil inside Tokens\",\n    \"Developer setup, providers, CLI and API moved to /docs/developers/\",\n    \"Existing PDFs preserved as the published October 2 edition\"\n  ],\n  \"current_recording\": {\n    \"path\": \"site/public/media/studio-guide/current/current-studio.mp4\",\n    \"duration\": 29.12,\n    \"captions\": [\n      \"current-en.vtt\",\n      \"current-fr.vtt\"\n    ],\n    \"capture_report\": \"site/public/media/studio-guide/current/capture.json\",\n    \"script\": \"site/scripts/record-studio-guide.mjs\",\n    \"boundary\": \"Read-only navigation of public base persona on local server; no generation, account, checkout or saving exercised.\"\n  }\n}\ndocs/studio-gu