{"parentUuid":"c62adc43-6bf6-48d2-8042-a362765e1e3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg1NXkY1EXAnqBa9nti61","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The rm and ffmpeg calls through the rtk proxy both check out fine. Now I'm trying to figure out how that longer English walkthrough video was actually produced — the narration note mentions captured screens with final-frame holds aligned to ElevenLabs timestamps, so I should check if there's a script in the git history or docs/plans.\n\nThe likely approach: replace the audio track by generating Cartesia audio for each caption cue, placing it at the cue start, fitting to duration with atempo, then remuxing with the original video. Some cues split mid-sentence so those need merging, and the fit would use atempo scaling up to about 1.15x or slow down otherwise — captions stay roughly valid at sentence level even if word timing drifts slightly. I should also check whether there's background music in the track, but the silence gaps matching cue gaps suggest it's voice-only.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1640,"cache_read_input_tokens":324089,"output_tokens":614,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":430},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1640,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":614,"cache_read_input_tokens":324089,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1640,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1640},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8285,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":