{"parentUuid":"608cec60-5123-437e-912b-52cbbf89a4c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg1Nkntza9EJASSNjHcTn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three English narrations now use Cartesia instead of the old ElevenLabs \"Aria\" voice. The voice is **Elaine** on `sonic-3.6`; Cartesia describes her as \"assured… calm confidence… guiding narration\". Your Cartesia key came from Skate (`cartesia_api_key@secrets`) and isn't saved in any file.\n\n**What changed**\n- **Tour (1:14)**\n  - Re-voiced and re-rendered, still exactly 74 s.\n  - Each new line is fitted to its scene, so the cuts, camera moves and captions still land on the words (slowest 0.90×, fastest 1.085×). Whisper re-timed every word for the captions.\n  - The HyperFrames check passed and the render is published to `site/public/media/tour/`.\n  - The old version is kept at `renders/baste-tour-aria.mp4`.\n- **Short Studio walkthrough (0:29):** re-voiced at the same length.\n- **Long English walkthrough (1:53)**\n  - Same picture; each sentence is re-spoken starting on its existing caption, so the captions stay accurate.\n  - The original is kept as `walkthrough-en.source.mp4`, which Git now ignores.\n- **French walkthrough:** unchanged, since you asked about English only.\n- **Loudness:** about −14 to −17 LUFS across the three.\n- **New scripts:**\n  - `scripts/cartesia.mjs`: the shared voice helper; change the voice there.\n  - `scripts/revoice-walkthrough.mjs`: re-voices the long walkthrough.\n  - `narrate-tour.mjs` and `narrate-studio-guide.mjs` now use Cartesia; the tour's word timings and music still come from fal.\n- **Docs:** `CARTESIA_API_KEY` is in `.env.example`, and the developer docs, `docs/development.md` and the video brief and script files are updated.\n- **Checks:** the site type check and lint are clean after the docs edits.\n\n**Before you rely on it**\n- **I chose Elaine without you hearing her.** I rendered samples of six voices but only compared speaking speed, not how they sound. Bronwen, my first pick, spoke too slowly to fit the tour's cut. To compare the same line before and after:\n  - `/tmp/voice-compare/tour-old.mp3`\n  - `/tmp/voice-compare/tour-new.mp3`\n\n  Six-voice samples (Bronwen, Elaine, Lauren, Marian, Theo, Clyde) are in `/tmp/cartesia-samples/`. If you'd prefer a different voice, I change one line in `scripts/cartesia.mjs` and rerun.\n- **The site dev server has stopped**, so I haven't checked the new audio in the browser.\n- The in-app companion voice (talking to a persona in the Studio) still uses fal/ElevenLabs. Tell me if you want that on Cartesia too."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":549,"cache_read_input_tokens":333079,"output_tokens":984,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":549,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":333079,"cache_creation_input_tokens":549,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":549},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6489d843-2844-44bf-8527-f69479479668","timestamp":"2026-10-14T02:55:20.575Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
