{"parentUuid":"45260df7-bac2-4ad7-97fd-77a50289eb80","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":["/home/diogenes/.t3/userdata/attachments"],"platform":"linux","shell":"bash","osVersion":"Linux 6.19.14-108.fc42.x86_64"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/videos/baste-tour"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4c5decb8-25ec-4c32-bc38-494693efbe07","timestamp":"2026-10-14T03:02:42.039Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site (was /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/videos/baste-tour)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste/site","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
{"parentUuid":"4c5decb8-25ec-4c32-bc38-494693efbe07","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg1PLSSsxPpnWCbtC1fLz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The tour and the Studio guide now show the new cyberbotanist icons (the mycelial network and the herbarium), not the old Recraft ones.\n\nTwo places had the old icons:\n\n- **The \"Ready to use\" spread in the tour (about 0:47–0:50):** it now shows the new icons, labelled \"Mycelial network\" and \"Herbarium collection\". The side panel says \"Vector icons · SVG · refined for UI\".\n- **The recorded Studio screen in the \"Cut\" chapter (about 0:45):** the screen recording still has the old icons baked in. I placed the new icons over those two tiles in the tour.\n  - **Studio guide clip:** the \"Draft prompts and generate\" clip had the same problem, so I patched it the same way, including while the page scrolls.\n  - **The Studio itself:** I also fixed the cause. The demo replay of a generation run now shows and downloads the new icons, so a future recording will be right without patching.\n\nThe tour is re-rendered (still 1:14, with the new Cartesia voice) and published to the site, along with the guide clip and its preview image. I checked frames at both places and the old icons don't appear. The site type check passes and the site tests pass (12 of 12).\n\nThe new icons are noticeably simpler and smaller than the old illustrated ones. In the tour's \"Cut\" chapter they sit centred in the same white tiles, so the tiles have more empty space around them than before."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":333,"cache_read_input_tokens":356572,"output_tokens":462,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":333,"ephem